# Generated Tauri sidecars
# Sidecars are native artifacts built by scripts/build-*-sidecar.sh and signed
# with the application. They are never committed: they are megabytes, they are
# specific to one machine's target, and the whole point of the build scripts is
# that they can be reproduced from a pinned source revision.
src-tauri/binaries/*
!src-tauri/binaries/README.md
